    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        331,
        1609,
        1761,
        1785
      ],
      "category": "Text",
      "text": "I am concerned about the use of city-owned and operated vehicles by city personnel. In past years, despite the existence of two executive orders, there have been some very loose policies and I firmly believe they should be ended.",
      "logprob_stats": {
        "bbox": {
          "n_tokens": 21,
          "mean": -0.258,
          "min": -1.3519
        },
        "category": {
          "n_tokens": 1,
          "mean": -0.0001,
          "min": -0.0001
        },
        "text": {
          "n_tokens": 44,
          "mean": -0.0008,
          "min": -0.034
        }
      },
      "ink": {
        "ink_px": 12517,
        "area_px": 251694,
        "density": 0.04973,
        "chars": 229,
        "chars_per_1k_ink": 18.3
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        328,
        1827,
        1761,
        2092
      ],
      "category": "Text",
      "text": "No one below the rank of commissioner should have a passenger vehicle or driver permanently assigned to him. (This does not, however, include trucks, vans, buses or other special purpose vehicles). When a Deputy Commissioner or a member of the Mayor's staff needs a passenger car or driver to perform city functions, a Department of Public Works pool car should be used.",
      "logprob_stats": {
        "bbox": {
          "n_tokens": 21,
          "mean": -0.1901,
          "min": -1.1438
        },
        "category": {
          "n_tokens": 1,
          "mean": -0.0,
          "min": -0.0
        },
        "text": {
          "n_tokens": 72,
          "mean": -0.0032,
          "min": -0.2269
        }
      },
      "ink": {
        "ink_px": 21914,
        "area_px": 379050,
        "density": 0.05781,
        "chars": 370,
        "chars_per_1k_ink": 16.88
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        328,
        2132,
        1781,
        2228
      ],
      "category": "Text",
      "text": "City vehicles should not be used for personal service by anyone during the week or on weekends.",
      "logprob_stats": {
        "bbox": {
          "n_tokens": 21,
          "mean": -0.2445,
          "min": -1.5052
        },
        "category": {
          "n_tokens": 1,
          "mean": -0.0,
          "min": -0.0
        },
        "text": {
          "n_tokens": 18,
          "mean": -0.0002,
          "min": -0.0036
        }
      },
      "ink": {
        "ink_px": 4203,
        "area_px": 140165,
        "density": 0.02999,
        "chars": 95,
        "chars_per_1k_ink": 22.6
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        328,
        2264,
        1807,
        2449
      ],
      "category": "Text",
      "text": "If commissioners themselves can do their work efficiently and productively without a car and driver assigned full time, they should, of course, do so. In any event, the car should be used by others during the day when not used by the commissioner.",
      "logprob_stats": {
        "bbox": {
          "n_tokens": 21,
          "mean": -0.2206,
          "min": -1.3407
        },
        "category": {
          "n_tokens": 1,
